    :param last: Last valid time for which states can be computed.
    :param segid: Segment identifier.
    :param gm: Gravitational parameter of central body.
    :param n: Number of states and epochs.
    :param states: States.
    :param epochs: Epochs."""
    return _context().spkw05(handle, body, center, inframe, first, last, segid, gm, n, states, epochs)

def spkw08(handle, body, center, inframe, first, last, segid, degree, n, states, epoch1, step):
