    :param n: Number of states.
    :param states: Array of states.
    :param epoch1: Epoch of first state in STATES array.
    :param step: Time step separating epochs of states."""
    return _context().spkw08(handle, body, center, inframe, first, last, segid, degree, n, states, epoch1, step)

def spkw09(handle, body, center, inframe, first, last, segid, degree, n, states, epochs):
    """Write a type 9 segment to an SPK file.
    
