    :param last: End time of interval covered by segment.
    :param segid: Segment identifier.
    :param nintvl: Number of mini-segments and interpolation intervals.
    :param npkts: Array of packet counts of mini-segments.
    :param subtps: Array of segment subtypes of mini-segments.
    :param degres: Array of polynomial degrees of mini-segments.
    :param packts: Array of data packets of mini-segments.
    :param epochs: Array of epochs of mini-segments.
